{"articleNo":"223924","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=223924&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[대학본부] 예비군 “휴일훈련” 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2019.04.19","hit":"7988","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"fr-view\"><p><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#0000ff;\">예비군&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;font-weight:bold;color:#0000ff;\">“</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#0000ff;\">휴일훈련</span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;font-weight:bold;color:#0000ff;\">”&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#0000ff;\">신청 안내</span></p><p style=\"color:#0000ff;\"><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;color:#0000ff;\">1.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#0000ff;\">신청장소&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;color:#0000ff;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#0000ff;\">예비군홈페이지</span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;color:#0000ff;\">(</span><a href=\"http://www.yebigun1.mil.kr/\"></a><u><a href=\"https://www.yebigun1.mil.kr/\">www.yebigun1.mil.kr</a></u><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;color:#0000ff;\">)</span></p><p style=\"color:#0000ff;\"><span style=\"color:#0000ff;\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#0000ff;\">예비군홈페이지 접속이 안될 경우 예비군연대에서</span><span style=\"color:#0000ff;\">신청하십시오</span></p><p style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#0000ff;\"><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;color:#0000ff;\">2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#0000ff;\">훈련일시&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;color:#0000ff;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;font-weight:bold;color:#0000ff;\">2019.5.25.(</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#0000ff;\">일</span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;font-weight:bold;color:#0000ff;\">)</span></p><p style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#0000ff;\"><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;color:#0000ff;\">3.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#0000ff;\">훈련장소&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;color:#0000ff;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#0000ff;\">대구시&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#0000ff;\">북구예비군훈련장</span></p><p style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#0000ff;\"><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;color:#0000ff;\">4.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#0000ff;\">훈련시간&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;color:#0000ff;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;font-weight:bold;color:#0000ff;\">1</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#0000ff;\">일&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;font-weight:bold;color:#0000ff;\">8h</span></p><p style=\"color:#0000ff;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#0000ff;\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;font-weight:bold;color:#0000ff;\">“</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#0000ff;\">이수하면</span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;font-weight:bold;color:#0000ff;\">”&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#0000ff;\">방학 중 실시하는 학교훈련</span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;font-weight:bold;color:#0000ff;\">(2019.7.1.</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#0000ff;\">∼</span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;font-weight:bold;color:#0000ff;\">7.10)</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#0000ff;\">과 동일하여 올해 훈련 끝</span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;font-weight:bold;color:#0000ff;\">(</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#0000ff;\">마무리</span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;font-weight:bold;color:#0000ff;\">)</span></p><p style=\"color:#0000ff;\"><span style=\"color:#0000ff;\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#0000ff;\">신청이 조기 마감될 수 있음</span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;color:#0000ff;\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0000ff;\">정원 초과</span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;color:#0000ff;\">)</span></p><p style=\"color:#0000ff;\"><span style=\"color:#0000ff;\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;color:#0000ff;\">7</span><span style=\"color:#0000ff;\">일전까지 취소 할 수 있음</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#0000ff;\">대학직장예비군연대장</span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\